  "changelog": "Initial release of api-gateway skill.\n\n- Provides a passthrough proxy to 100+ APIs (Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, Notion, Slack, Airtable, HubSpot, etc.) with managed OAuth via Maton.\n- Base URL: `https://gateway.maton.ai/{app}/{native-api-path}`; requires `MATON_API_KEY` for authentication.\n- Includes detailed instructions for connection management (create, list, get, delete) via `https://ctrl.maton.ai`.\n- Supports specifying active connections using the `Maton-Connection` header.\n- Lists supported third-party services and proxy naming conventions.\n- Security: API key does not grant access by itself\u2014user OAuth authorization required for each service.",
